Successful execution of the 2025 Territory Plan requires tight alignment with other departments:

*   **Product (PROD-XXX):** The sales team will prioritize selling the **MedSync Compliance Suite** in Q1 2025, aligning with the product team's roadmap for new regulatory updates (See PROD-001 for product details).
*   **Marketing (MKTG-XXX):** Marketing campaigns will be heavily weighted towards lead generation in EMEA and APAC to support the new territory teams.
*   **Finance (FIN-XXX):** All territory performance will be tracked against the financial model (See FIN-002 for detailed budget tracking).

